# Browser-safe client configuration only. Never add backend Routes credentials,
# private credentials, signing material, or unrelated server secrets here.
#
# Flutter Web receives this value at build time through --dart-define or
# --dart-define-from-file; flutter_dotenv does not initialize Google Maps.
# Local and Railway DEV may use the same restricted DEV Web key, whose Google
# Cloud restrictions must allow only the approved local/DEV browser origins.
GOOGLE_MAPS_WEB_API_KEY=
